   "start": 81.5,
   "duration": 11.0,
   "speaker": null,
   "voice": null,
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Тварь! Ты обманул нас! Завёл в ловушку!"
   },
   "source": "World/Quests/Ferris_indoor/Ferris_3_4_2/LastDie_Sub17.(ClientData).xdb"
  },
  {
   "n": 13,
   "start": 85.5,
   "duration": 11.0,
   "speaker": null,
   "voice": null,
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Мы уничтожим тебя! Уничтожим всех вас, одного за другим!"
   },
   "source": "World/Quests/Ferris_indoor/Ferris_3_4_2/LastDie_Sub18.(ClientData).xdb"
  },
  {
   "n": 14,
   "start": 91.5,
   "duration": 6.0,
   "speaker": "colossus",
   "voice": {
    "event": "Cutscenes/Ferris4/CS_FR_CarrierVayatel11",
    "wave": "CS_FR_CarrierVayatel11",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_CS_FR602_cs_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/14.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/14.mp3",
    "duration": 8.007
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Смешно. Уничтожив меня, вы закроете себе дорогу домой.",
    "en": "This is funny. If you destroy me, you will destroy your way back home.",
    "fr": "C'est amusant. Si vous me détruisez, vous détruirez votre chemin de retour."
   },
   "source": "World/Quests/Ferris_indoor/Ferris_3_4_2/LastDie_Sub11.(ClientData).xdb"
  },
  {
   "n": 15,
   "start": 99.5,
   "duration": 7.0,
   "speaker": "colossus",
   "voice": {
    "event": "Cutscenes/Ferris4/CS_FR_CarrierVayatel12",
