    "duration": 10.007
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Я выполнил наш договор. Вы прервали Путь, но вам не одолеть архитектора.",
    "en": "I have fulfilled our agreement. You interrupted the Passage, but you cannot defeat the Architect.",
    "fr": "J'ai respecté notre accord. Vous avez coupé le Passage, mais vous n'avez pas vaincu l'Architecte."
   },
   "source": "World/Quests/Ferris_indoor/Ferris_3_4_2/LastDie_Sub12.(ClientData).xdb"
  },
  {
